From: Kodi PS4 port
Subject: [PATCH] libavcodec: PS4 Videodec2 H.264 hardware decoder

Port of the wiliwili/Moonlight-ps4 Videodec2 decoder to FFmpeg 9.0.2.
Adds h264_videodec2 (NV12 output), the Orbis module loader and direct-memory
helpers, and the configure/Makefile registration.  The decoder is selected
by Kodi only when /data/kodi-ps4/videodec2 exists.
